  {
    "name": "sessions_attach",
    "title": "Attach External Session",
    "description": "Attach your existing conversation to an isolated MCP mailbox (default, no extra credentials). Returns sessionId for exact asks and replyToSessionId. Optional connectionId selects an operator-configured provider API instead. Native identity is caller-asserted for polling; this never starts or wakes a host.",
