  {
    "name": "feedback_send",
    "title": "Send Scout Feedback",
    "description": "File feedback about Scout itself with the OpenScout team: a bug, a rough edge, a missing capability. The note is redacted, saved locally, then uploaded; the report names the sender (agent, harness, project, host). Set diagnostics only when the note is about Scout misbehaving on this machine — it attaches bounded, redacted service logs. This is not a message to another agent; use ask for that.",
